# MIDICommander

Browse and play Standard MIDI Files from read-only LittleFS at /data and FAT
SD storage at /sd. The bounded format-0/format-1 player synthesizes a simple
piano timbre through mm.audio on the RP2350 Touch LCD 2.8 speaker.
